Package: karchi-headless
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: karchi <karchi@localhost>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd-resolved, systemd-timesyncd, libpam-systemd, iwd, wireless-regdb, tailscale, tailscale-archive-keyring, fastfetch, keyd, systemd-zram-generator, btrfs-progs, sudo, openssh-client, ca-certificates, curl, nano, less
Description: KarchiOS Headless on Debian: the whole system as one package
 A laptop as a server without a desktop. The lid does nothing and the machine
 never sleeps; the display is off until SUPER+D; Wi-Fi through iwd, Tailscale,
 fastfetch at login. Its dependencies are everything the system has beyond
 Debian's base, its files are the settings.
